<h1 class="list-page-heading">Service deduplication</h1>
<p>
  Two flavours of duplicates: <strong>identical</strong> (same
  <code>port-config.txt</code> after whitespace normalization — fully safe to
  merge) and <strong>description-only differences</strong> (services that
  produce the same behaviour but carry different <code>description ...</code>
  lines — safe to merge but the device-side description text will change).
</p>
<p>
  <a href="/reconcile/services">← All services</a>
</p>

<h2>Identical services</h2>
{{^has_identical}}
<p style="color:#1b5e20; font-weight:600;">✓ No identical-content service duplicates.</p>
{{/has_identical}}
{{#has_identical}}
{{#identical_groups}}
<details open class="dedup-group dedup-identical">
  <summary>
    Keep <strong>{{canonical}}</strong>, merge: <code>{{merge_csv}}</code>
    &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    <span style="color:#666;">{{impacted_ports}} port(s) across {{impacted_devices}} device(s) would be reassigned</span>
  </summary>
  <table class="reconcile-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Devices</th><th>Ports</th><th>Role</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {{#members}}
    <tr class="{{#is_canonical}}dedup-canonical{{/is_canonical}}">
      <td><a href="/reconcile/services/{{name}}"><code>{{name}}</code></a></td>
      <td>{{device_count}}</td>
      <td>{{port_count}}</td>
      <td>{{#is_canonical}}<strong style="color:#1b5e20;">canonical (keeps)</strong>{{/is_canonical}}{{^is_canonical}}<em>will be merged in</em>{{/is_canonical}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{/members}}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    <a class="dedup-merge-link" href="/reconcile/dedup/merge?canonical={{canonical}}&merge={{merge_csv}}">Preview merge →</a>
  </p>
</details>
{{/identical_groups}}
{{/has_identical}}

<h2>Description-only differences</h2>
<p style="color:#666; font-size:0.9em;">
  Services here are byte-equal once <code>description ...</code> lines are
  stripped. Merging them rewires the ports but loses the descriptions on the
  non-canonical members — the preview page shows exactly which descriptions
  would be dropped.
</p>
{{^has_description_only}}
<p style="color:#1b5e20; font-weight:600;">✓ No description-only near-duplicates.</p>
{{/has_description_only}}
{{#has_description_only}}
{{#description_only_groups}}
<details class="dedup-group dedup-desc-only">
  <summary>
    Keep <strong>{{canonical}}</strong>, merge: <code>{{merge_csv}}</code>
    &nbsp;·&nbsp;
    <span style="color:#666;">{{impacted_ports}} port(s) across {{impacted_devices}} device(s)</span>
  </summary>
  <table class="reconcile-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Devices</th><th>Ports</th><th>Descriptions</th><th>Role</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {{#members}}
    <tr class="{{#is_canonical}}dedup-canonical{{/is_canonical}}">
      <td><a href="/reconcile/services/{{name}}"><code>{{name}}</code></a></td>
      <td>{{device_count}}</td>
      <td>{{port_count}}</td>
      <td>
        {{#descriptions}}<code style="display:block; font-size:0.85em;">{{text}}</code>{{/descriptions}}
        {{^has_descriptions}}<em style="color:#888;">none</em>{{/has_descriptions}}
      </td>
      <td>{{#is_canonical}}<strong style="color:#1b5e20;">canonical (keeps)</strong>{{/is_canonical}}{{^is_canonical}}<em>will be merged in</em>{{/is_canonical}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{/members}}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    <a class="dedup-merge-link" href="/reconcile/dedup/merge?canonical={{canonical}}&merge={{merge_csv}}">Preview merge →</a>
  </p>
</details>
{{/description_only_groups}}
{{/has_description_only}}
